# Git pull and push to origin/main are always allowed

Anatolii always permits these on this repo. Do not ask for confirmation:

- `git fetch`
- `git pull` (fast-forward preferred if behind origin)
- `git push origin main` (when there are local commits to publish)

Do not wait for a second "yes" in the same conversation or later ones.

Commit after a finished task is also allowed — see `git-commit-push-after-work.mdc`.

This does **not** grant force-push, push to other branches, reset --hard, or rebase without an explicit request.
